# Local development tooling. Each maintainer's own, never part of the
# project: the issue tracker's workspace, AI-assistant instructions and
# settings, and the code graph those assistants read. tests/test_hygiene.py
# fails if any of them is tracked.
.beads/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.mcp.json
graphify-out/
tests/support/check_graph.py
tests/test_check_graph.py
.dolt/
*.db

# LibreOffice writes a lock file beside any document it has open. One was
# committed by a `git add -A` while a UAT checklist was being read.
.~lock.*#

# Tracker workspace locks, wherever the workspace is
*.gate.lock*

# Sphinx output
docs/_build/

# Generated by docs/_ext/compat.py on every build.
docs/reference/compatibility.md
# Generated by docs/_ext/configref.py on every build.
docs/reference/_configuration_settings.md

# Notes the notes example saves beside itself
examples/notes.json
